category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libgmp10 libstdc++6
sdesc: "C library for manipulating polynomials (runtime)"
ldesc: "LibPoly is a C library for manipulating polynomials. The target applications
are symbolic reasoning engines, such as SMT solvers, that need to reason about
polynomial constraints. It is research software under development, so the
features and the API might change rapidly."
external-source: libpoly

